---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="StudyGenie - AI Study Companion | Summarize, Quiz, Flashcards">

  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 pt-16 pb-20 text-center">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-sm font-medium mb-6" style="background: rgba(99,102,241,0.1); color: #6366f1; border: 1px solid rgba(99,102,241,0.2);">
      <span>Powered by Google Gemini AI</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold leading-tight mb-6" style="color: var(--text);">
      Study smarter, not harder.<br/>
      <span class="gradient-text">Your AI study companion.</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="text-lg md:text-xl max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8" style="color: var(--text-muted);">
      Paste any text, article, or notes. Get instant summaries, flashcards, quizzes, and simple explanations. Powered by AI, built for students.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3 mb-8">
      <a href="/tools/summarize" class="btn btn-brand btn-lg w-full sm:w-auto">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg>
        Start Studying Free
      </a>
      <a href="#features" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg w-full sm:w-auto">See How It Works</a>
    </div>

    <p class="text-sm" style="color: var(--text-muted);">No signup needed. 5 free uses per day. No credit card.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- Demo Preview -->
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 mb-20">
    <div class="card" style="padding: 0; overflow: hidden; border: 2px solid var(--border);">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-3" style="background: var(--bg-alt); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">
        <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full" style="background: #ef4444;"></div>
        <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full" style="background: #f59e0b;"></div>
        <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full" style="background: #10b981;"></div>
        <span class="ml-2 text-xs font-medium" style="color: var(--text-muted);">StudyGenie - AI Summarizer</span>
      </div>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2" style="min-height: 300px;">
        <div class="p-6" style="border-right: 1px solid var(--border);">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide mb-3" style="color: var(--text-muted);">Input</p>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--text);">Photosynthesis is a process used by plants and other organisms to convert light energy into chemical energy that can later be released to fuel the organism's activities. This chemical energy is stored in carbohydrate molecules, such as sugars and starches, which are synthesized from carbon dioxide and water...</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6" style="background: var(--bg-alt);">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide mb-3" style="color: #6366f1;">AI Output</p>
          <div class="space-y-3 text-sm">
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold" style="color: var(--text);">Summary</p>
              <p style="color: var(--text-muted);">Photosynthesis converts light energy into chemical energy stored as sugars, using CO2 and water as inputs.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold" style="color: var(--text);">Key Points</p>
              <ul class="space-y-1" style="color: var(--text-muted);">
                <li>- Plants convert light to chemical energy</li>
                <li>- Energy stored as carbohydrates (sugars)</li>
                <li>- Requires CO2 + water + sunlight</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold" style="color: var(--text);">Flashcard</p>
              <div class="px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs" style="background: rgba(99,102,241,0.1); color: #6366f1;">
                Q: What are the inputs of photosynthesis? <br/>
                A: Carbon dioxide, water, and sunlight
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Features -->
  <section id="features" class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 mb-20">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4" style="color: var(--text);">Everything you need to ace your studies</h2>
      <p class="text-lg" style="color: var(--text-muted);">Five powerful AI tools, one platform. All free.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
      <a href="/tools/summarize" class="feature-card">
        <div class="text-3xl mb-3">📝</div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2" style="color: var(--text);">AI Summarizer</h3>
        <p class="text-sm" style="color: var(--text-muted);">Paste any text, article, or chapter. Get a concise summary, key points, and important terms instantly.</p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-sm font-semibold" style="color: #6366f1;">Try it free &rarr;</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/tools/flashcards" class="feature-card">
        <div class="text-3xl mb-3">🃏</div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2" style="color: var(--text);">Flashcard Generator</h3>
        <p class="text-sm" style="color: var(--text-muted);">Turn any study material into interactive flip cards. Practice active recall the smart way.</p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-sm font-semibold" style="color: #6366f1;">Try it free &rarr;</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/tools/quiz" class="feature-card">
        <div class="text-3xl mb-3">🧪</div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2" style="color: var(--text);">Quiz Generator</h3>
        <p class="text-sm" style="color: var(--text-muted);">Auto-generate MCQ questions from your notes. Test yourself before exams and track your score.</p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-sm font-semibold" style="color: #6366f1;">Try it free &rarr;</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/tools/explain" class="feature-card">
        <div class="text-3xl mb-3">💡</div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2" style="color: var(--text);">Explain Like I'm 5</h3>
        <p class="text-sm" style="color: var(--text-muted);">Confused by a concept? Get a simple explanation with analogies, examples, and step-by-step breakdowns.</p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-sm font-semibold" style="color: #6366f1;">Try it free &rarr;</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/tools/youtube" class="feature-card">
        <div class="text-3xl mb-3">🎬</div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2" style="color: var(--text);">YouTube Summarizer</h3>
        <p class="text-sm" style="color: var(--text-muted);">Paste a YouTube video URL. Get a summary, key points, and timestamps without watching the full video.</p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-sm font-semibold" style="color: #6366f1;">Try it free &rarr;</span>
      </a>

      <div class="feature-card" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(99,102,241,0.05), rgba(236,72,153,0.05)); border-style: dashed;">
        <div class="text-3xl mb-3">🚀</div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2" style="color: var(--text);">More Coming Soon</h3>
        <p class="text-sm" style="color: var(--text-muted);">PDF upload, essay grader, math solver, study planner, and more. We ship new tools every week.</p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-sm font-semibold" style="color: var(--text-muted);">Stay tuned</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How It Works -->
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 mb-20">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12" style="color: var(--text);">How it works</h2>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 text-2xl font-bold" style="background: rgba(99,102,241,0.1); color: #6366f1;">1</div>
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-2" style="color: var(--text);">Paste your content</h3>
        <p class="text-sm" style="color: var(--text-muted);">Copy-paste text from textbooks, articles, notes, or any study material.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 text-2xl font-bold" style="background: rgba(16,185,129,0.1); color: #10b981;">2</div>
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-2" style="color: var(--text);">AI processes it</h3>
        <p class="text-sm" style="color: var(--text-muted);">Google Gemini AI analyzes your content and generates study material in seconds.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 text-2xl font-bold" style="background: rgba(245,158,11,0.1); color: #f59e0b;">3</div>
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-2" style="color: var(--text);">Study smarter</h3>
        <p class="text-sm" style="color: var(--text-muted);">Review summaries, flip flashcards, take quizzes, and master any topic faster.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Pricing -->
  <section id="pricing" class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 mb-20">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-4" style="color: var(--text);">Simple, transparent pricing</h2>
    <p class="text-center mb-10" style="color: var(--text-muted);">Start free. Upgrade when you need more.</p>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <div class="pricing-card">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-1" style="color: var(--text);">Free</h3>
        <p class="text-sm mb-4" style="color: var(--text-muted);">Perfect for trying it out</p>
        <div class="mb-6">
          <span class="text-4xl font-extrabold" style="color: var(--text);">₹0</span>
          <span class="text-sm" style="color: var(--text-muted);">/forever</span>
        </div>
        <ul class="text-sm space-y-3 mb-6 text-left" style="color: var(--text-muted);">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span style="color: #10b981;">✓</span> 5 AI generations per day</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span style="color: #10b981;">✓</span> All 5 tools included</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span style="color: #10b981;">✓</span> Summaries, flashcards, quizzes</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span style="color: #10b981;">✓</span> No signup required</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span style="color: var(--text-muted);">-</span> Limited to 5 uses/day</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/tools/summarize" class="btn btn-outline w-full">Get Started Free</a>
      </div>

      <div class="pricing-card featured">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-1" style="color: var(--text);">Pro</h3>
        <p class="text-sm mb-4" style="color: var(--text-muted);">For serious students</p>
        <div class="mb-6">
          <span class="text-4xl font-extrabold" style="color: var(--text);">₹299</span>
          <span class="text-sm" style="color: var(--text-muted);">/month</span>
        </div>
        <ul class="text-sm space-y-3 mb-6 text-left" style="color: var(--text-muted);">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span style="color: #10b981;">✓</span> Unlimited AI generations</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span style="color: #10b981;">✓</span> All 5 tools included</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span style="color: #10b981;">✓</span> PDF upload support</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span style="color: #10b981;">✓</span> Priority AI processing</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span style="color: #10b981;">✓</span> Save & export notes</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span style="color: #10b981;">✓</span> No ads</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#" class="btn btn-brand w-full">Coming Soon</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Testimonials / Social Proof -->
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 mb-20">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-10" style="color: var(--text);">Built for students like you</h2>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold" style="background: rgba(99,102,241,0.1); color: #6366f1;">R</div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold" style="color: var(--text);">Rahul S.</p>
            <p class="text-xs" style="color: var(--text-muted);">IIT Bombay</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm" style="color: var(--text-muted);">"The quiz generator is insane. I paste my lecture notes and get perfect MCQs in seconds. Saved me hours before my midterms."</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold" style="background: rgba(16,185,129,0.1); color: #10b981;">P</div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold" style="color: var(--text);">Priya M.</p>
            <p class="text-xs" style="color: var(--text-muted);">NEET Aspirant</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm" style="color: var(--text-muted);">"The flashcard feature is a game-changer. I create cards from NCERT chapters and review them on my phone. My retention improved so much."</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold" style="background: rgba(245,158,11,0.1); color: #f59e0b;">A</div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold" style="color: var(--text);">Amit K.</p>
            <p class="text-xs" style="color: var(--text-muted);">CA Student</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm" style="color: var(--text-muted);">"Explain Like I'm 5 helped me understand complex accounting concepts. It breaks things down with real-world examples. Love it!"</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 mb-20">
    <div class="text-center py-12 px-8 rounded-2xl" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(99,102,241,0.08), rgba(236,72,153,0.05)); border: 1px solid rgba(99,102,241,0.15);">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-4" style="color: var(--text);">Ready to study smarter?</h2>
      <p class="mb-6" style="color: var(--text-muted);">Join thousands of students using AI to learn faster. Free, no signup needed.</p>
      <a href="/tools/summarize" class="btn btn-brand btn-lg">
        Start Studying Now
        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
